        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jody Allen, Paul Allen\n- Companies: Vulcan Inc., Microsoft\n- Places: Seattle, Washington\n- Products: Tatoosh, Octopus\n- Roles: chief executive officer, co-founder, investor, philanthropist\n\nFacts:\n- Paul Gardner Allen was born on January 21, 1953.\n- Paul Allen is an American business magnate, investor, and philanthropist.\n- Paul Allen co-founded Microsoft.\n- Jody Allen is Paul Allen's sister.\n- Jody Allen served as the chief executive officer of Vulcan Inc. until October 2015.\n- Vulcan Inc. was Paul Allen's investment and project management company based in Seattle, Washington.\n- Paul Allen owned the 303-foot private yacht Tatoosh.\n- Paul Allen also owned the 416-foot yacht Octopus.",
